Licensing status: UNDECIDED

This repository intentionally does not apply a single license to all of its
contents. The following components will eventually be licensed separately,
but no final licensing choice has been made yet:

1. Pipeline source code (src/, scripts/, tests/)
2. Curated structured data (data/, sources/)
3. Authored documentation and guides (docs/, guides/, README.md, etc.)

Until a decision is made:
- Do not assume any permission to reuse, redistribute, or relicence the
  contents of this repository beyond what default copyright law allows.
- External projects linked from this archive remain under their own licenses;
  this repository links to original sources and does not redistribute their
  source code.

To resolve this, the maintainers should:
- Choose an approved open-source license for the code (e.g. MIT, Apache-2.0).
- Choose a suitable license or public-domain dedication for curated data
  (e.g. CC0, CC-BY-4.0).
- Choose a suitable license for guides and documentation.
- Record the decision in this file and in docs/source-policy.md.
